Clone the Repository

cd dbbot
npm install
cp config.json-DEFAULT config.json

Edit config.json with your discord bot API key and for any other settings you
want to change.

./startup.sh &

Close shell and reconnect if you need to connect to console or something.
Leaving the shell open and closing your computer will result in the program
terminating. Closing the shell on command terminates normally and leaves it
running in the background. Trust me on this one. Save yourself some time and
headaches.
